{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"feel\": \"他像还停留在刚才的亲近里，身体被一阵阵摇曳托着，心思舒服地漂开；暂时不急着行动，也不急着把关系推向下一步。\",\n      \"why\": \"前一段的期待持续下来却没有伤害他，原先必须随时防备的身体状态因此开始松动（H5）；而这段相处已经有了足够的长度，不再只是刚发生的一瞬（H6）。他暂时不必追问或推动什么，可以让亲近的余温在身体里多停留一会儿，注意力也就有了自然游移的余地。\",\n      \"op\": \"加一条局部因果桥\",\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"H\": [\n          \"H5\",\n          \"H6\"\n        ],\n        \"M\": [],\n        \"orig\": []\n      },\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"S03-B1\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"feel\": \"舒服的漂浮中忽然冒出一下短促的急切，像有个念头想往前说，却没能接成完整的倾诉，很快又沉回屏息等待的状态。\",\n      \"why\": \"相处越久，他越清楚自己舍不得这段亲近；这种舍不得积累到一定程度时，身体可能先于念头冒出一阵想再靠近的冲动（H6；M38）。但他仍不能确定对方的心意，也没有新的把握让这股冲动真正落定（H2），所以它没有接成明确的表达或答案。强烈的感受过去之后，他仍然放不下，急切便重新收成悬而未落的期待（M39）。\",\n      \"op\": \"说清已有因果\",\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"H\": [\n          \"H2\",\n          \"H6\"\n        ],\n        \"M\": [\n          \"M38\",\n          \"M39\"\n        ],\n        \"orig\": [\n          3\n        ]\n      },\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"S03-B2\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"feel\": \"温柔和亲近仍在，心里却像多了一股拖住思绪的暗流：某个尚未能说清的问题一闪一闪地回来，念头绕行、停在半途，既没有形成答案，也没有完全散去。\",\n      \"why\": \"前面的安稳确实缓解了悬着的感觉，却没有证明所有需要都已得到照顾（H4）。相处越有分量，他越会在意自己的亲近对方究竟知不知道（H6；M23）；但他只能确定自己的感受，不能凭自己的喜欢替对方作答（H2）。越想弄清这个问题，越发现再用力也不能立刻获得确定，向前追问的劲头便转成了卡住的等待（M31）。因此，温柔之中出现了阻力和思绪的滞留，却不等于亲近已经消失或两个人已经分离。\",\n      \"op\": \"换候选\",\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"H\": [\n          \"H2\",\n          \"H4\",\n          \"H6\"\n        ],\n        \"M\": [\n          \"M23\",\n          \"M31\"\n        ],\n        \"orig\": []\n      },\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"S03-B3\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "117feedf-b9d7-42e4-a621-c84ba0d5a086", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T140828502009Z", "elapsed_seconds": 348.047, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T14:14:16.568869+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "88e6b18ca74739d0f694d0e964637e73ee7f99d352aef30012f58f535d91b475", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T140828502009Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "dbd6dd1cdaadecd4b26f7d4823a5b8ada331ff80f9f3aba7e4b9754a64276435"}}}
